WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.240
Should we have seen Black Widow's tragic ending
coming all along?

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.300
Did we all miss the clues that foreshadowed
her doom?

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.180
Keep watching to find out!

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:15.539
Born in Soviet Russia in 1984, the young Natasha
Romanoff — before she had that name — was

00:00:15.539 --> 00:00:19.660
purchased by the state from her parents as
an infant after it was determined that she

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.710
had great genetic potential to serve their
needs.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:28.816
Early training helped Natasha learn to obey
her masters, and soon she would have her first mission.

00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:34.850
Sent to the United States as a child, Natasha
and fellow assassin-in-training Yelena Belova

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:40.680
would be raised by adoptive "parents," a pair
of Russian assassins named Alexei and Melina.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:46.000
This fake family unit would allow the four
to pose as a normal American suburban household.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
But when Alexei and Melina completed their
mission to steal valuable U.S. intelligence,

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.240
they were discovered by SHIELD.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:58.579
The two Russian agents scooped up Natasha
and Yelena and, after a tense chase, flew

00:00:58.579 --> 00:01:02.820
them out of the country, where they would
be taken in by Alexei's superior: General

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:08.390
Dreykov, a ruthless Russian leader who oversaw
the assassin training program known as the

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.490
Red Room.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:15.960
Following their return to Russia, both Natasha
and her "sister" Yelena were taken to be trained

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:19.590
as assassins in Dreykov's sinister Red Room
program.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:24.790
During her time in the Red Room, Natasha would
become one of the best killers in the program,

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:28.180
with unmatched instincts and marksmanship
skills.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:32.970
She would also undergo rigorous psychological
programming and conditioning that would essentially

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.430
make her a slave to Dreykov.

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:39.100
But her training in the Red Room was about
more than just developing her skills.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:45.030
Doctors within the Academy also gave Romanoff
a hysterectomy, as they did to all their assassins.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:50.159
The hope was that making the trainees unable
to bear children would ensure the total absence

00:01:50.159 --> 00:01:51.159
of familial connections.

00:01:51.159 --> 00:01:54.810
"They have a graduation ceremony.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:59.200
They sterilize you."

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:04.020
Romanoff spent years acting as one of Russia's
best assassins, putting her on the radar of

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.810
American intelligence agencies.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:10.480
Eventually she would be targeted by Nick Fury,
director of SHIELD.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.720
Agent Clint Barton — later known as the
hero Hawkeye — would be assigned by Fury

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.050
to kill Natasha.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:20.230
But over the course of his mission, Barton
instead convinced Natasha that she should

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:23.300
defect to the United States and join SHIELD.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:28.500
To earn the agency's trust, Natasha's first
mission was to accompany Barton to Budapest

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.580
and kill her former teacher, Dreykov.

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:36.280
Romanoff hesitated at the prospect of bombing
Dreykov with his young child in tow, but she

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:41.300
would ultimately give the order to detonate,
apparently killing both Dreykov and Antonia

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.480
and officially earning Natasha a place as
a SHIELD agent.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.770
"Just like Budapest all over again!"

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:51.600
"You and I remember Budapest very differently."

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:56.200
Now in the employ of SHIELD, Romanoff quickly
became one of their best agents and was sent

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.510
on a number of critical assignments.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:03.540
During a 2009 extraction mission in Iran,
the Winter Soldier — who was once Captain

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:08.780
America's friend Bucky Barnes — ambushed
her and killed her target, a nuclear scientist,

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:11.660
by firing straight through Romanoff's stomach.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:16.370
Though she learned little about the Winter
Soldier, she knew enough to fear him.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:21.450
One person she knew a lot about was the future
Avenger called Iron Man.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:25.730
After developing his first armored suits,
Tony Stark came to the attention of SHIELD

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:29.620
and was identified by Fury as a candidate
for the Avengers Initiative.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:34.840
Sent undercover under the name "Natalie Rushman,"
Natasha became Stark's new assistant.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:39.010
Assigned to keep tabs on the budding hero,
Romanoff would eventually reveal her identity

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:44.060
as a SHIELD agent when Stark came into conflict
with Ivan Vanko, and she aided him in stopping

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.420
the new armored villain.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:49.700
However, the intelligence gathered by Romanoff
on her mission led Fury to the conclusion

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:54.840
that Stark was not suitable for his planned
super-team, deeming the billionaire volatile,

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:58.390
self-obsessed, and a poor team player.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:02.400
"Textbook narcissism?

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.400
Agreed."

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:09.460
In 2012, Nick Fury gathered the superheroes
who would later be known as the Avengers.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:13.770
Romanoff was sent to India, where she located
Bruce Banner — a scientist with expertise

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:18.620
in gamma radiation, who also happened to be
the human identity of the monster known as

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:19.900
The Hulk.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:24.690
Convincing Banner to help SHIELD locate the
Tesseract, Romanoff got Banner aboard Fury's

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:29.380
helicarrier, where the two of them joined
up with Tony Stark, Thor, and Steve Rogers,

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.510
aka Captain America.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:35.230
After capturing Loki in Germany, however,
the team began to fracture.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:40.060
Natasha was able to trick Loki into revealing
his plans to set off Banner's transformation

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:44.280
into the Hulk, but was unable to prevent it
— following an argument with Fury and the

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:50.378
other heroes, Banner did transform, and the
Hulk smashed his way through even the mighty Thor.

00:04:50.378 --> 00:04:55.090
But when Loki used the Tesseract to bring
an invading alien army to Earth, the team

00:04:55.090 --> 00:05:00.150
began to gel, and Natasha joined them in the
fight against the invading Chitauri warriors.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:05.250
After saving the day, Romanoff and the newly-formed
Avengers went their separate ways, but they

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.750
were now the world's mightiest team of superheroes.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:13.960
Two years after the Battle of New York, when
Georges Batroc led a group of terrorists in

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:19.350
an attack on the SHIELD carrier Lemurian Star,
Romanoff retrieved classified files while

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.949
Steve Rogers took out the enemy soldiers.

00:05:21.949 --> 00:05:27.030
From that intel, Romanoff, Fury, and Rogers
uncovered evidence that SHIELD was being secretly

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:32.150
run by the remnants of the terrorist organization
known as HYDRA, and planned on deploying three

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:35.750
new helicarriers that would allow them to
take over the planet.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:41.250
Romanoff was faced with a fateful decision:
If she exposed SHIELD (and HYDRA) to the public,

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:44.100
she'd also be exposing her own past.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:49.261
Between her loyalty to Fury and her friendship
with Steve Rogers, however, it wasn't a hard choice.

00:05:49.261 --> 00:05:54.460
Alongside Rogers and new hero Sam Wilson,
she helped defeat HYDRA and take down SHIELD

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.930
for good.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:00.030
As a member of the Avengers, Natasha Romanoff
went on a number of missions with her new

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.630
team and grew closer to her teammate, Bruce
Banner.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.410
Natasha was the one person capable of calming
the Hulk when they needed him to revert to

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:13.010
his human form, and their relationship slowly
began to blossom into a tentative romance.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:18.060
Romanoff would later be captured by Ultron,
but still proved instrumental in his downfall.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:22.650
After defeating Ultron and his robot army,
Romanoff attempted to talk down the Hulk over

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:27.420
the phone while he sat at the controls of
a Quinjet, but he ignored her pleas to return

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:30.150
and flew away to parts unknown.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:35.180
After Ultron's defeat, Romanoff found herself
an elder statesman on a new team of Avengers

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:41.290
that now included Wanda Maximoff, the android
Vision, and Sam Wilson, the Falcon.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:45.880
Romanoff became a leader on the team alongside
Rogers, but her position next to Captain America

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.650
wouldn't last long.

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:51.919
Following a mission to Lagos that resulted
in the deaths of civilians, the Avengers found

00:06:51.919 --> 00:06:56.660
themselves at odds with the Sokovia Accords,
a United Nations resolution that would see

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:01.030
them become an officially sanctioned arm of
the world's governments.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:06.130
Romanoff advocated going along with the order,
but Rogers, Wilson, Maximoff, and Clint Barton

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.700
split with the team and went on the run.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:13.250
With a battle of heroes on the horizon, it
was Romanoff who recruited the Wakandan prince

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:17.230
T'Challa, the Black Panther, to join them
in stopping Rogers' team.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:21.370
But in a confrontation in Germany between
the two factions, Romanoff was once again

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:26.650
forced to choose between her loyalty to Rogers
and Barton, and the orders of her superiors.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:31.320
Forced to fight Barton hand-to-hand, she was
stopped by Wanda Maximoff, but ultimately

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:35.530
prevented Black Panther from capturing Rogers
and allowed him to escape.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:40.060
When all was said and done, Romanoff left
Stark's team and struck out on her own, in

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.400
defiance of the law.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:47.110
Romanoff and her fellow fugitive Avengers
soon found themselves being hunted by an obsessed

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:50.230
Thaddeus Ross, the Secretary of Defense.

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:54.930
Alone and in hiding, Natasha sought the help
of old friends around the globe, including

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:59.300
former SHIELD agent Rick Mason, now operating
as an independent contractor.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:03.800
But when she received a mysterious package
and became the target of a shadowy assassin

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:10.518
called the Taskmaster, she began a new mission
to track down her adopted Soviet sister, Yelena Belova.

00:08:10.518 --> 00:08:15.080
When they met in Budapest, they realized that
the Red Room was not destroyed after all,

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:20.370
and that Dreykov had escaped Romanoff's assassination
attempt back when she first joined SHIELD.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:24.240
The two sisters reunited with their "parents,"
Alexei and Melina.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:28.710
The former false family worked together to
stop Dreykov and take down the Red Room 

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:29.710
once and for all.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:34.760
To do that, however, they'd have to get past
the Taskmaster (who turned out to be none

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:39.310
other than Dreykov's daughter) as well as
a new group of deadly Black Widow agents whom

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:42.670
they also hoped to free from Dreykov's mind
control.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:47.920
The plan succeeded — the Red Room was destroyed,
and Dreykov was killed by Belova — but it

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.570
also put Romanoff back on Ross' radar.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:54.650
He arrested her, but she escaped his custody
with ease and went on a mission to spring

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:55.750
the others from jail.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.529
"It's funny, my whole life I didn't think
I had any family.

00:08:59.529 --> 00:09:01.110
Turns out I got two."

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:05.520
Still a fugitive from the government and still
being hounded by Ross at the start of "Avengers:

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:11.130
Infinity War," Romanoff joined Rogers and
Wilson as an underground team of heroes.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:16.510
But in 2018, the interstellar tyrant Thanos
sent his Black Order to Earth to steal the

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:22.000
Mind Stone, one of the six Infinity Stones
Thanos required to wipe out half of all existing

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.800
life forms, and which happened to reside in
Vision's head.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:31.600
With fellow heroes Iron Man, Spider-Man, and
Doctor Strange unexpectedly off-planet, Romanoff

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:35.860
and her team stepped forward to help defend
their planet once again.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:40.190
Reunited with Bruce Banner, Natasha began
assembling forces and making plans to prevent

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.960
Thanos from retrieving the Mind Stone.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:48.170
Assisted by T'Challa and his army of Wakandan
warriors, Romanoff would hide Vision in Wakanda

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:51.730
in a last ditch effort to defeat the overpowered
Titan.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:56.700
Several Avengers helped Natasha and her forces
in their valiant defense of Vision, but in

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.940
the end, Thanos simply proved too much for
them.

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:04.610
He took the Mind Stone, and with a snap of
his fingers, eliminated half of all life in

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:06.330
the universe.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:10.960
Retreating to the Avengers Compound back in
upstate New York, Romanoff, Rogers, and the

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:14.570
other heroes who survived "the Snap" licked
their wounds.

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:18.900
Even taking their revenge on Thanos didn't
help matters — the Infinity Stones had already

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.830
been destroyed, and the damage was done.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:26.290
Natasha took on a leadership position in the
Avengers, coordinating global recovery efforts

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:30.270
and assisting cosmic heroes like Rocket Raccoon
and Captain Marvel.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:34.370
But five years after the Snap, the pressures
of leadership and the trauma of loss were

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.470
clearly starting to take their toll.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:41.850
So when Scott Lang, aka Ant-Man, returned
from the quantum realm with a plan to change

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:46.510
history, Natasha gladly suited up as the Black
Widow once again to save the world.

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:52.480
Of course, to do so, she had to first travel
to Japan to recruit her old friend Clint Barton,

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:58.116
who had lost his entire family to the Snap
and who had become a violent anti-hero called Ronin.

00:10:58.116 --> 00:11:02.710
Once they were back together, however, Romanoff
and the rest of the original Avengers — alongside

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:07.860
Rocket and Thanos' estranged daughter Nebula
— embarked on a mission to travel back in

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:13.750
time and re-assemble the Infinity Gauntlet
in order to undo Thanos' heinous act.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:19.029
Upon journeying into the past, the remaining
Avengers split into smaller teams to accomplish

00:11:19.029 --> 00:11:20.620
individual tasks.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:25.690
Barton and Romanoff took the Guardians of
the Galaxy's spaceship to the planet of Vormyr,

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:27.390
home of the hidden Soul Stone.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:31.670
There, they found the ghostly form of the
Red Skull, banished there since attempting

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:36.820
to wield the Tesseract back in World War II,
who told the pair a grim truth: to obtain

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:39.580
the Soul Stone, one of them had to die.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:45.480
In one of the most tragic moments in the entire
MCU, Romanoff made the ultimate sacrifice,

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:50.070
giving her life so that Barton could be reunited
with his wife and son, a final gift to him

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:54.520
for his years of friendship and restitution
for rescuing her from the Red Room.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:59.750
The debt she felt she owed Barton had at last
been repaid, for it was he who had given her

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:06.170
a new life as the Black Widow — a daughter,
a sister, a hero, and an Avenger forever.

